          </div>
          <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <div class="step-text">Scale up climate finance 3–6× for adaptation</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-num">4</div>
            <div class="step-text">Protect and restore carbon sinks</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-item">
            <div class="step-num">5</div>
            <div class="step-text">Secure a liveable future for all</div>
          </div>
